  {"i":3184,"t":["language","thinking"],"n":"Learners meet 例 as 'example'. The 'custom' sense appears as 例の 'the usual', not cultural custom, so the culture entry is dropped."},
  {"i":3186,"t":["function"],"n":"Learned as the set adverbial 自分の力で 'by oneself', close to reflexive 自分で. 'qualities' does not fit."},
  {"i":3203,"t":["movement"],"n":"Mimetic manner word for turning round and round. It is not a grammar word, so 'function' is dropped."},
  {"i":3247,"t":["technology","qualities"],"s":{"5":["money","shopping"]},"n":"Mostly met as the main unit of a device. 本体価格 on price tags is a common pre-tax-price sense taught with money and shopping."},
